{"suttaId":"thag2.49","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1123,1138],"vripara":"217"},"segments":{"thag2.49:0.4":"Sandhitattheragāthā","thag2.49:1.1":"“Assatthe haritobhāse, saṃvirūḷhamhi pādape;","thag2.49:1.3":"Ekaṃ buddhagataṃ saññaṃ, alabhitthaṃ [alabhiṃ haṃ (ka.)] patissato.","thag2.49:2.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ saññamalabhiṃ tadā;","thag2.49:2.3":"Tassā saññāya vāhasā, patto me āsavakkhayo”ti.","thag2.49:2.5":"… Sandhito thero ….","thag2.49:2.6":"Vaggo pañcamo niṭṭhito.","thag2.49:3.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","thag2.49:3.1":"Kumārakassapo thero, dhammapālo ca brahmāli;","thag2.49:3.3":"Mogharājā visākho ca, cūḷako ca anūpamo;","thag2.49:3.5":"Vajjito sandhito thero, kilesarajavāhanoti.","thag2.49:3.7":"Dukanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag2.49:4.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag2.49:4.1":"Gāthādukanipātamhi, navuti ceva aṭṭha ca;","thag2.49:4.3":"Therā ekūnapaññāsaṃ, bhāsitā nayakovidāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
